
#DESCRIPTION
1D oblique shock test: 64 cells in x, flow along x into a reflecting left wall,
open inflow right boundary.  The upstream magnetic field is inclined at 45 deg to
the shock normal (the x axis): Bx = B0*cos(45), Bz = B0*sin(45), B0 = 1.044e-8 T.
Used to debug the reflect-field (fixed-to-upstream) boundary with a non-zero
normal field component, which the 2D oblique shock showed is incompatible with a
PEC/conducting wall (E_t=0 contradicts the bulk motional E = -u x B).

NOTE: ported from the wip/hybrid-bc-regression shock test. That branch used the
old inject BC and its injection block, which do not exist on feat/boundary-
conditions.  The inject open face is reproduced here with the clean inflow BC
(BC::inflow) on the right (+x) face; the left wall uses the reflect-field BC
(BC::fixed, same EM machinery as inflow) so the ghost B/E stay pinned to the
upstream state while particles reflect.  The upstream state is supplied via the
INFLOW command in SI units.

#INITFROMSWMF
F                       initFromSWMF

#GEOMETRY
0.0                     xMin
64.0                    xMax
-0.5                    yMin
 0.5                    yMax
-0.5                    zMin
 0.5                    zMax

#NCELL
64                      nCellX
1                       nCellY
1                       nCellZ

#MAXBLOCKSIZE
128                     maxBlockSizeX
1                       maxBlockSizeY
1                       maxBlockSizeZ

#PERIODICITY
F                       isPeriodicX
T                       isPeriodicY
T                       isPeriodicZ

#BFIELDBOXBOUNDARY
fixed                   bfieldBoxBoundaryLo
inflow                  bfieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                bfieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                bfieldBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                bfieldBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                bfieldBoxBoundaryHi

#PARTICLEBOXBOUNDARY
0                       iSpecies
reflect                 particleBoxBoundaryLo
inflow                  particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryLo
periodic                particleBoxBoundaryHi

#SOLVEEM
F                       solveEM

#HYBRIDPIC
T                       useHybridPIC

#AVGFIELDB
T                       useAvgFieldB
20                      nAvgFieldB

#HALLTERM
T                       useHallTerm

#BSUBCYCLE
1                       nBSubcycle

#RESISTIVITY
1.0e7                   etaResistivity

#HYPERRESISTIVITY
5.0e17                  etaHyperSI
si                      etaHyperMode
0.0                     etaHyperCh

#ELECTRONTEMPERATURE
141.0                   electronTemperature
1.6667                  electronGamma
5.0                     electronDensity0

#PLASMA
1                       nSpecies
1.0                     mass
1.0                     charge

45 deg oblique: |B| = 1.044e-8 T, Bx = Bz = 1.044e-8 * cos(45) = 7.382e-9 T
#INFLOW
7.382e-9                bx [T]
0.0                     by [T]
7.382e-9                bz [T]
5.0                     rho [amu/cc]
-713.0                  ux [km/s]
0.0                     uy [km/s]
0.0                     uz [km/s]
6.28e5                  T [K]

motional E = -u x B = (0, -ux*Bz, 0); ux=-713e3 m/s, Bz=7.382e-9 T
   -> Ey = -ux*Bz = +5.263e-3 V/m
#UNIFORMSTATE
5.0                     rho
-713.0                  ux
0.0                     uy
0.0                     uz
6.28e5                  T
7.382e-9                bx
0.0                     by
7.382e-9                bz
0.0                     ex
5.263e-3                ey
0.0                     ez

#TIMESTEPPING
T                       useFixedDt
0.005                   dt

#NORMALIZATION
1.0e5                   lNormSI
1.0e5                   uNormSI

#MONITOR
50                      dnReport

#SAVELOG
10                      dnSavePic
10                      dnSavePT

#PARTICLES
100                     npcelx
1                       npcely
1                       npcelz

#SAVEPLOT
1                       nPlot
y=0 fluid ascii pic     plotString
50                      dn
-1                      dt
1                       dx
rhoS0 uxS0 uyS0 uzS0 Bx By Bz Ex Ey Ez   plotVar

#STOP
-1                      MaxIter
5.0                     TimeMax

#RUN
